    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just burnout though. it’s more like the \"me\" part is just... evaporating. like the person who used to have opinions and memories is just gone and there’s nothing left but this hollow shell. it’s terrifying but also kinda makes me feel like there’s nothing left to hold onto. like why even try to stay present when there's nobody even here to experience it?",
